                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0c83b455-be3c-3192-8012-57028070e7f9",
                        "entry_id": "0832b08e-3644-3f0a-9e5d-6b59d2c2bd9b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "by God"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dated"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c78d765e-2b99-4ff4-9043-c603a052a6fd",
                                "sense_id": "0c83b455-be3c-3192-8012-57028070e7f9",
                                "text": "Pardieu ! je le crois bien, s’écria Sancho, qu’il était sage et enchanteur, puisque, à ce que dit le bachelier, Samson Carrasco (c’est ainsi que s’appelle celui dont je viens de parler), l’auteur de l’histoire se nomme Cid Hamet Berengen.",
                                "translation": "\"By God! I do believe,\" cried Sancho, \"that he was a sage and an enchanter, because, according to what the bachelor, Samson Carrasco (for that's the name of the one that I just talked about), says, the author of the story was named Cid Hamet Berengen.\"",
                                "english": "\"By God! I do believe,\" cried Sancho, \"that he was a sage and an enchanter, because, according to what the bachelor, Samson Carrasco (for that's the name of the one that I just talked about), says, the author of the story was named Cid Hamet Berengen.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
